---
// The one piece of color in the system: a 24px sapphire gradient square used
// as chromatic punctuation. Decorative only — never a background or a fill.
---

<span class="marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>

<style>
  .marker {
    display: block;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-marker);
    background: var(--gradient-sapphire-beam);
  }
</style>
